[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (-1.7,0) arc (180:0:1.7);
\draw (-1.7,0) arc (180:360:1.7 and 0.5);
\draw[dashed] (1.7,0) arc (0:180:1.7 and 0.5);
\fill (0,0) circle (1.2pt);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(-20:1.7 and 0.5) node[midway,below,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$8\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
This is an **open** hemispherical bowl (no flat face). Find its surface area in exact form, in terms of $\pi$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (-1.7,0) arc (180:0:1.7);
\draw (-1.7,0) arc (180:360:1.7 and 0.5);
\draw[dashed] (1.7,0) arc (0:180:1.7 and 0.5);
\fill (0,0) circle (1.2pt);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(-20:1.7 and 0.5) node[midway,below,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$7\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
This is a **closed** solid hemisphere (it includes its flat circular face). Find its surface area in exact form, in terms of $\pi$.
